        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-488, Distressed Oval Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple oval rose is suitable for use with almost any cabinet knob such as the <a href=\"/products/distressed-egg-shaped-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-710\">Distressed Egg Shaped Cabinet Knob</a>. The classic design allows it to blend seamlessly with all types of knob styles, providing your cabinets with an added layer of breathtaking beauty. We all know that it is the little details that bring a room together and really make it stand out, and this Distressed Oval Knob Rose made by RK International will do just that. It measures 1-1/2 inches long and 7/8 inches wide. Available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-488 Distressed Cabinet Knob Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TR100_size.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
